      "text": "In the words of the late great Mo Udall - the voters have spoken, the bastards\u2026\n\n\nDecision Desk HQ (@DecisionDeskHQ)\n\nDecision Desk HQ projects the VA Congressional Redistricting Referendum will Pass.\n\nWhile No currently has the lead, based on the location and size of the remaining vote, Yes will take the lead as soon as the remaining counties report.\n\n#DecisionMade: 8:25 PM EDT\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/DecisionDeskHQ/status/2046747257932816683#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2046753773297475843",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-22T00:51:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": ".@bdomenech - let\u2019s do a date night! \u2665\ufe0f\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\nTom Cruise (@TomCruise)\n\nIf you feel the need...Two films. One big screen. Back in theaters, May 13th, for one week only.\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/TomCruise/status/2046574783756919098#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2046643279807062274",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-21T17:32:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We are so excited to have @SenFettermanPA joining me and @mirandali on Citizen McCain tomorrow. Please answer below with anything you want us to ask him. \n\n(Reminder we are a fun, respectful show and like to laugh with our guests). \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2046627341997085031",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-21T16:29:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If you live in Virginia, remember to vote NO on the communist takeover of elections today.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2046607192166371563",
