    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Fuck right off.\n\n\nRyan Grim (@ryangrim)\n\nIt's amazing that Trump can trash Meghan McCain's dad for years but all it takes to win her over is a war on Iran. Truly her father's daughter. He'd be genuinely proud.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/ryangrim/status/2046560952439459944#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2046580825332867294",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-21T13:24:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Just to be clear - Tucker would have preferred Kamala Harris be president?\n\n\n\ud835\udc0c\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc1c\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc26 (@Malcolm_Pal9)\n\nTucker Carlson says:\n\n\"I\u2019m sorry for misleading people. I will feel bad for a long time because I helped Trump get elected.\"\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Malcolm_Pal9/status/2046498286836875458#m",
